infographic hierarchy-tree-curved-line-rounded-rect-node
data
  root
    label High-water mark breach: choose by data semantics
    children
      - label Option A — Evict the connection
        children
          - label Fits broadcast services — each slow client is independent
          - label Close with code 1013; client reconnects when network clears
      - label Option B — Drop old messages
        children
          - label Fits idempotent data — latest value supersedes older
          - label Keep newest N per connection; current state on reconnect
      - label Option C — Pause the producer
        children
          - label Fits peer-to-peer streams — every byte matters
          - label Signal sender to stop until queue drains below low-water mark
